% 📋 `semio / viz / spatial / layout` -- options every spatial algorithm reads through
% \SemioVizLayout. Each algorithm documents which subset it uses.
%   x0, y0, x1, y1  (clip rectangle of the voronoi cells)   default 0, 0, 100, 100
